# EXPECT: a charter that does not say who issued it
# MESSAGE: A charter needs exactly one issuing organisation
@prefix org:  <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#> .
@prefix mbr:  <https://w3id.org/membership#> .
@prefix mbrc: <https://w3id.org/membership/code/> .
@prefix ex:   <https://example.org/invalid/> .

ex:Lodge a mbr:MembershipOrganization ; org:classification mbrc:privateClub .
ex:c a mbr:Charter ; mbr:issuedTo ex:Lodge ; mbr:charterStatus mbrc:charterGranted .
